


S Key: Toggles the SpongeBob and Pineapple House layer on or off.

R Key: Switches your tool to Reveal Mode to paint the original sunset colors.

I Key: Switches your tool to Invert Mode to paint color-negated versions of the scene.

E Key: Switches your tool to Erase Mode to wipe away painted areas with solid black strokes.

Spacebar: Enters Neutral Mode to pause drawing while moving your mouse freely.

C Key: Clears the entire canvas back to solid black and turns off the character layer.
